, "role": "assistant"}, "channel": "final", "content": {"content_type": "text", "parts": ["Yep. We went down that road already, and the fix is: **stop trying to pass the yellow Text block at all.**\n\nUse the Scriptable action’s **Texts** section as the payload directly.\n\nUnder **Run GCE_Capture → Texts**:\n\n1. Tap **Add New Item**\n2. First text item: type exactly  \n   `action_button`\n3. Tap **Add New Item** again\n4. Second text item: insert the **Dictated Text** variable directly from the Dictate Text action\n\nSo the Scriptable action gets two text inputs:\n\n```text\nTexts:\n  1. action_button\n  2. [Dictated Text]\n```\n\nThen we make the script read:\n\n```javascript\nconst trigger = args.plainTexts[0]\nconst rawText = args.plainTexts[1]\n```\n\nThat completely removes the stupid middle **Text block** and avoids the parameter/file picker mess.\n\nSo yes: **delete the yellow Text action entirely** once we wire those two Text items.\n\nThe shortcut becomes:\n\n```text\nDictate Text\n↓\nRun GCE_Capture\n  Texts:\n    action_button\n    [Dictated Text]\n```\n\nThat is much cleaner. And this time we are using the UI you actually have in front of you, not trying to force a generic “Parameter” workflow onto it."]}, "create_time": 1790137339.145553, "end_turn": true, "id": "7387c62b-c614-4236-b79a-50211259ad75", "metadata": {"can_save": true, "citations": [], "code_blocks": {"0": {"edited": false, "id": "5few09", "preview_language": null, "previewable": false}, "1": {"edited": false, "id": "xtf6n3", "preview_language": null, "previewable": false}, "2": {"edited": false, "id": "s1fxz2", "preview_language": null, "previewable": false}}, "content_references": [{"alt": "", "end_idx": 1103, "has_images": false, "matched_text": " ", "prefix": null, "prompt_text": null, "refs": [], "safe_urls": [], "sources": [], "start_idx": 1102, "type": "sources_footnote"}], "conversation_followup_suggestions_eligible": true, "cot_version": "v5", "default_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-think