lready knows what triggered it.\n\nSo the new minimal path is:\n\n```text\nDictate Text\n↓\nRun GCE_Capture\n  Texts:\n    [Dictated Text]\n```\n\nNo yellow Text block. No `Parameter`. No typed `action_button` in the Shortcut.\n\nThat removes the exact UI problem you just proved."]}, "create_time": 1790137488.772813, "end_turn": true, "id": "d415c448-405c-42f0-93df-f7df2904b7b2", "metadata": {"can_save": true, "citations": [], "code_blocks": {"0": {"edited": false, "id": "pqdink", "preview_language": null, "previewable": false}, "1": {"edited": false, "id": "19g992", "preview_language": null, "previewable": false}}, "content_references": [], "conversation_followup_suggestions_eligible": true, "cot_version": "v5", "default_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "finish_details": {"stop_tokens": [200002], "type": "stop"}, "is_complete": true, "message_type": "next", "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "model_switcher_deny": [], "parent_id": "8cc5b806-f944-4642-b96b-dbbef3e851f4", "request_id": "6904325f-ecad-4e98-a120-82cabd4d0a16", "resolved_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "search_result_groups": [], "story_events": [], "thinking_effort": "standard", "turn_exchange_id": "81791fd4-0f8c-455c-acdd-a88d6ac82925", "working_turn_id": "81791fd4-0f8c-455c-acdd-a88d6ac82925"}, "recipient": "all", "status": "finished_successfully", "update_time": 1790137496.981207, "weight": 1}, {"author": {"metadata": {}, "name": null, "role": "user"}, "channel": null, "content": {"content_type": "text", "parts": ["Okay, but it didn't capture any text. I just ran it."]}, "create_time": 1790137513.914793, "end_turn": null, "id": "67064352-b992-42c1-b61c-de9928c54cf1", "metadata": {"can_save": false, "dictation": true, "dictation_asset_format": "m4a", "dictation_asset_pointer": "sediment://file_00000000556481fdaa0b3eb911db7cb1", "dictation_auto_submitted": true, "dictation_edited": false, "dictation_original_text": "Okay, but it didn't capture any text. I just ran it.", "message_source": null, "reques