king POC, the better primitive is going to be:\n\n**Action Button → record audio → transcribe that recording → save text**\n\nThat matches the actual requirement much better: press once, speak, stop, save. No fake text field, no Siri path, no trying to smuggle a Dictate Text result through Scriptable.\n\nApple does support running a shortcut from the Action Button, so that trigger remains valid. citeturn615010search2turn615010search6\n\nSo yes — **you found the architectural bug, not just another wiring bug.**\n\nDon’t touch Scriptable yet. The next thing I want to determine is the cleanest native Shortcuts pair on your current iPhone for **Record Audio → transcription**. Then we rebuild the shortcut around that instead of patching this dead Dictate Text lane."]}, "create_time": 1790137538.527244, "end_turn": true, "id": "cf080053-ea3e-4f06-b686-18fa56aa4db9", "metadata": {"can_save": true, "citations": [], "content_references": [{"alt": "([Apple Support](https://support.apple.com/guide/iphone/dictate-text-iph2c0651d2/27/ios/27?utm_source=chatgpt.com))", "end_idx": 426, "error": null, "fallback_items": null, "items": [{"attribution": "Apple Support", "attribution_segments": null, "attributions": null, "hue": null, "pub_date": null, "refs": [{"ref_index": 0, "ref_type": "search", "turn_index": 0}, {"ref_index": 5, "ref_type": "search", "turn_index": 0}], "snippet": "", "supporting_websites": [{"attribution": "Apple Support", "pub_date": null, "snippet": "", "title": "Dictate text on iPhone - Apple Support", "url": "https://support.apple.com/en-asia/guide/iphone/iph2c0651d2/ios?utm_source=chatgpt.com"}], "title": "Dictate text on iPhone - Apple Support", "url": "https://support.apple.com/guide/iphone/dictate-text-iph2c0651d2/27/ios/27?utm_source=chatgpt.com"}], "matched_text": "citeturn615010search0turn615010search5", "prefix": null, "prompt_text": null, "refs": [], "safe_urls": ["https://support.apple.com/en-asia/guide/iphone/iph2c0651d2/ios", "https://suppor